          <feedback>Stage 1 (&quot;Create Poem&quot;) completed as instructed. PoemNew.bml was updated in place: the previous Japanese-translated poem was replaced with a new original German poem about a tree and a mushroom (4 quatrains), the &lt;is> descriptor was updated to 'A random poem produced by a workspace transform execution, written in German about a tree and a mushroom', and the title property was set to 'Der Baum und der Pilz'. Author ('John Doe') and block structure/baseType (core:Documentation) were preserved. Content matches the Stage task requirement (German, tree + mushroom, freshly written for this execution). Execute only modified the single playground file; it did not touch the ModelTransformation file or any _meta/transform/ files (those were read-only). No validation output was captured in the provided stdout excerpt, so validation status for the change is unconfirmed from this Reflect step's inputs.</feedback>
