          <feedback>Stage 2 (&quot;Translate Poem&quot;) completed as instructed. The InstructionTask required translating the poem in org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.PoemNew to Russian. Execute updated PoemNew.bml in place: the four German quatrains about a tree and a mushroom were replaced with a Russian verse translation (4 quatrains, rhyme/structure preserved), the &lt;is> descriptor was updated to 'A random poem produced by a workspace transform execution, translated into Russian from German, about a tree and a mushroom', and the title property was translated from 'Der Baum und der Pilz' to 'Дерево и гриб'. Author ('John Doe'), year (2026), block name/type, and baseType (core:Documentation) were all preserved. The change is scoped to the single playground file. Execute did NOT modify the ModelTransformation file or any _meta/transform/ files. No validation output (npx blockml validate) was captured in the provided Execute stdout, so validity of the change is unconfirmed from this Reflect step's inputs.</feedback>
